## Build invariants

- **14 SOW pages + Privacy.** Vocational is retired (`/programs/vocational/` 301s to the CDS vocational section).
- Pages are **generated**, not hand-built: `_tools/build_pages.py`, `_tools/build_home_replica.py`, then `_tools/apply_elementor.sh`. Fixes are scripts in `_tools/` too — re-run them instead of editing pages in Elementor.
- **Hero padding is CSS-owned** (it tracks the transparent header height per band: 176 / 151 / 190 / 177px). Changing it in Elementor does nothing; edit the `/* GSM hero vertical centring */` block or re-measure the header first.
- **Post template** is Theme Builder `Single Post — News`, condition `include/singular/post` (never `include/general` — that leaked onto `/news/` and duplicated the H1 and CTA band).
- **Editability contract:** `_tools/audit_editability.php` must report 0 raw HTML widgets, 0 shortcodes, 0 per-element custom CSS, 0 inline `<style>`/`<script>`.
- Reusable modules only: `PageHero`, `SplitSection`, `AboutMissionSection`, `HomeIntroStrip`, `HistoryTimelineSection`, `AffiliationsSection`, `SectionTabs`.
- `AGENTS.md` wins over chat history; `src/pages/SitemapPage.jsx` wins over `design/sitemap-structure.md`; locked slugs win over hash links.

